WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.727
Sometimes one summary is not enough.

00:00:02.727 --> 00:00:10.227
We may want the number of orders, total revenue, and average order value for each channel at the same time.

00:00:10.227 --> 00:00:15.767
The aggregate method lets us calculate several grouped metrics in one operation.

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:24.962
Named aggregation is especially useful because we choose clear output names such as orders, revenue, and average order.

00:00:24.962 --> 00:00:30.012
That makes the result easier to read and closer to a reporting table.

00:00:30.012 --> 00:00:34.132
This pattern is common in dashboards and business reports.

00:00:34.132 --> 00:00:41.525
Rather than producing several separate tables, one grouped summary can collect the key metrics needed for comparison.
